## How to do common things

### Check gateway status
```bash
systemctl --user status openclaw-gateway
journalctl --user -u openclaw-gateway -n 50
```

### Restart the gateway
```bash
systemctl --user restart openclaw-gateway
```

### Check gateway health
```bash
curl -s http://localhost:18789/health
```

### View session state
```bash
ls ~/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/
```

## Notes
- Workspace path is `{{WORKSPACE_DIR}}` — set explicitly in `openclaw.json`. Do not rely on defaults.
- If heartbeats fail with ECONNREFUSED, check firewall rules to the Ollama host on port 11434.
- Installed by Open Civitas on {{INSTALL_DATE}}.
